  "entrypoint": "forward_resource_design.evaluate_owned_function",
  "statement": "Source evaluation does not establish any generated contract or predecessor entailment.",
  "limitations": [
    "Unknown ownership stops propagation.",
    "Unsupported source expressions remain explicit.",
    "A jump at a CFG return site leaves the function as a function_return exit; any other unknown target stops the path.",
    "An address that carries an owned array base and a symbolic addend reads that array as a list lookup; its index range is a path condition and an open read obligation. A write at a symbolic index still has no owner.",
    "A call ends its block; its return site is a cut that continues only from a call-return seed (call_boundary.call_return_seed). Loop cuts require source-bound inputs."
  ]
